  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Choucroute garnie is a one-pot meal built on "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "sauerkraut",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "sauerkraut"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " slow-cooked with lardons, sausages, and white wine. You "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "deglaze",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "deglaze"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " the pan with wine after browning the pork to pick up all the sticky flavour before the sauerkraut goes in. The result is mellow and warming."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Rinse the sauerkraut before using. It brings the acidity to a gentler level without losing the character."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
